cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NegaraKu.md — an open, AI-friendly knowledge base about Malaysia"
message: >-
  If you use NegaraKu.md content or data, please cite it as below and retain
  attribution as required by the CC BY-SA 4.0 licence on the content.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  NegaraKu.md is an open-source, curated and cited knowledge base about Malaysia,
  written as Markdown that both people and large language models can read. It
  spans law, taxation, business, government, culture and daily life across 13
  languages, with every factual claim sourced to primary authorities and a
  human-review trust model. Article content is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0; the site
  source code is MIT.
